# Raw feed/HTML/LLM response blobs — bulky, retained locally + in GH Actions artifacts.
data/raw/

# The SQLite DB is distributed as a rolling GitHub Release asset (data-latest),
# NOT committed — keeps it out of git history. See DECISIONS.md D-38 (supersedes
# D-13's commit-the-DB choice). The daily job publishes it; the dashboard downloads it.
data/tyler.db

# Transient run logs (tee'd output from ingest/watchlist runs)
data/*.log

